    thinking: "**Constructing the Three.js Scene**\n\nI\'m now diving into building the Three.js scene for the Hero Section. My current focus is implementing a clean and elegant 3D scene, as per the specifications. I will be working with just 2 or 3 floating gourmet plates.\n\n\n**Refining the Gourmet Dishes**\n\nI\'m now implementing the 3D model of floating gourmet plates. I\'m focusing on their subtle movement \342\200\223 slow rotation and gentle vertical floating. The lighting needs to be soft and realistic with delicate shadows. I\'m also planning mouse interaction for parallax. I am working on the procedural modeling for the ceramics and food, including the smaller side saucer.\n\n\n\n"
