l bg-[#3A4335] text-[#FAF8F5] hover:bg-[#C86D51] transition-colors cursor-pointer self-end md:self-auto\"\n            aria-label=\"Volver arriba\"\n          >\n            <ArrowUp className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Bottom copyright & legal */}\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#D4C7B0]/60 font-sans\">\n          <p>\302\251 {new Date().getFullYear()} Sabor Vivo. Experiencias gastron\303\263micas privadas. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex gap-6 text-[11px]\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:underline\">Aviso Legal</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:underline\">Pol\303\255tica de Privacidad</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:underline\">Cookies</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n};\n"
