    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Artistic Flair\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Artistic Flair\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\'es\' class=\'h-full\'><head><style>:root{--bg:#F5F2ED;--ink:#2A2A2A;--olive:#5A5A40;--terra:#D27D56;--cream:#EADDCA}body{background-color:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;height:768px;width:1024px}h1,h2{font-family:\'Georgia\',serif;font-weight:300}.nav-link{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--ink);opacity:0.7}.pill-tag{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border:1px solid rgba(42,42,42,0.15);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px}.dish-blob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}.card-shadow{box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(90,90,64,0.06)}</style></head><body class=\'flex flex-col\'><nav class=\'h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-12 border-b border-black border-opacity-5\'><div class=\'text-xl tracking-widest uppercase font-light\'>Sabor<span class=\'text-terra italic\'>Vivo</span></div><div class=\'flex gap-8\'><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link\'>Servicios</a><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link\'>Especialidades</a><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link\'>Metodolog\303\255a</a><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link font-bold opacity-100\'>Contacto</a></div></nav><main class=\'flex-grow grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 p-12 overflow-hidden\'><section class=\'col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-center pr-12\'><div class=\'mb-4\'><span class=\'pill-tag text-olive\'>Catering Boutique</span></div><h1 class=\'text-6xl leading-tight mb-6\'>Experiencias gastron\303\263micas <span class=\'italic\'>que se sienten</span></h1><p class=\'text-lg opacity-60 mb-8 max-w-md\'>Catering premium y chefs privados dedicados a la creaci\303\263n de momentos memorables a trav\303\251s de la alta cocina org\303\241nica.</p><div><button class=\'bg-olive text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-sm tracking-widest text-xs uppercase hover:bg-opacity-90\'>Solicitar cotizaci\303\263n</button></div></section><section class=\'col-span-6 relative flex items-center justify-center\'><div class=\'absolute w-80 h-80 bg-cream rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl\'></div><div class=\'dish-blob w-56 h-56 z-20\' style=\'background-image:linear-gradient(45deg, #e2e2e2, #f9f9f9); border: 8px solid white;\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\'><svg width=\'140\' height=\'140\' viewBox=\'0 0 100 100\' fill=\'var(--olive)\' opacity=\'0.8\'><path d=\'M50 10 C30 10 10 30 10 50 S30 90 50 90 S90 70 90 50 S70 10 50 10 M50 80 C35 80 20 65 20 50 S35 20 50 20 S80 35 80 50 S65 80 50 80\' /><circle cx=\'50\' cy=\'50\' r=\'5\'/></svg></div></div><div class=\'dish-blob w-40 h-40 z-10 -top-4 -right-4\' style=\'background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, #eee, #ddd); border: 6px solid white;\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-30 text-xs italic\'>Ceviche Mar</div></div><div class=\'dish-blob w-32 h-32 z-30 bottom-12 -left-8\' style=\'background-image:linear-gradient(225deg, #f5f2ed, #eaddca); border: 4px solid white;\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-40 text-xs italic\'>Tartar Sol</div></div></section><section class=\'col-span-12 grid grid-cols-4 gap-6 mt-4\'><div class=\'bg-white p-6 card-shadow border border-gray-50 flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-terra font-serif text-2xl mb-2\'>01</span><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>Catering Privado</h3><p class=\'text-xs opacity-60\'>Eventos exclusivos dise\303\261ados a medida para su hogar o empresa.</p></div><div class=\'bg-white p-6 card-shadow border border-gray-50 flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-terra font-serif text-2xl mb-2\'>02</span><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>Chef en Casa</h3><p class=\'text-xs opacity-60\'>La excelencia de un restaurante Michelin en la intimidad de su mesa.</p></div><div class=\'bg-white p-6 card-shadow border border-gray-50 flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-terra font-serif text-2xl mb-2\'>03</span><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>Catas & Maridaje</h3><p class=\'text-xs opacity-60\'>Viajes sensoriales guiados por nuestros sumilleres expertos.</p></div><div class=\'bg-olive text-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center\'><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>\302\277Hablamos?</h3><p class=\'text-[10px] opacity-80 mb-4\'>Iniciemos la planeaci\303\263n de su pr\303\263ximo evento.</p><span class=\'border-b border-white border-opacity-40 text-[10px] pb-1 cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-tighter\'>Formulario de contacto</span></div></section></main><footer class=\'h-12 border-t border-black border-opacity-5 px-12 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] opacity-50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\'><div>Barcelona &bull; Madrid &bull; Marbella</div><div>&copy; 2024 Sabor Vivo - Alta Cocina</div></footer></body></html>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Artistic Flair\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Artistic Flair\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\'es\' class=\'h-full\'><head><style>:root{--bg:#F5F2ED;--ink:#2A2A2A;--olive:#5A5A40;--terra:#D27D56;--cream:#EADDCA}body{background-color:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;height:768px;width:1024px}h1,h2{font-family:\'Georgia\',serif;font-weight:300}.nav-link{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--ink);opacity:0.7}.pill-tag{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border:1px solid rgba(42,42,42,0.15);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px}.dish-blob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}.card-shadow{box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(90,90,64,0.06)}</style></head><body class=\'flex flex-col\'><nav class=\'h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-12 border-b border-black border-opacity-5\'><div class=\'text-xl tracking-widest uppercase font-light\'>Sabor<span class=\'text-terra italic\'>Vivo</span></div><div class=\'flex gap-8\'><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link\'>Servicios</a><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link\'>Especialidades</a><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link\'>Metodolog\303\255a</a><a href=\'#\' class=\'nav-link font-bold opacity-100\'>Contacto</a></div></nav><main class=\'flex-grow grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 p-12 overflow-hidden\'><section class=\'col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-center pr-12\'><div class=\'mb-4\'><span class=\'pill-tag text-olive\'>Catering Boutique</span></div><h1 class=\'text-6xl leading-tight mb-6\'>Experiencias gastron\303\263micas <span class=\'italic\'>que se sienten</span></h1><p class=\'text-lg opacity-60 mb-8 max-w-md\'>Catering premium y chefs privados dedicados a la creaci\303\263n de momentos memorables a trav\303\251s de la alta cocina org\303\241nica.</p><div><button class=\'bg-olive text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-sm tracking-widest text-xs uppercase hover:bg-opacity-90\'>Solicitar cotizaci\303\263n</button></div></section><section class=\'col-span-6 relative flex items-center justify-center\'><div class=\'absolute w-80 h-80 bg-cream rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl\'></div><div class=\'dish-blob w-56 h-56 z-20\' style=\'background-image:linear-gradient(45deg, #e2e2e2, #f9f9f9); border: 8px solid white;\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\'><svg width=\'140\' height=\'140\' viewBox=\'0 0 100 100\' fill=\'var(--olive)\' opacity=\'0.8\'><path d=\'M50 10 C30 10 10 30 10 50 S30 90 50 90 S90 70 90 50 S70 10 50 10 M50 80 C35 80 20 65 20 50 S35 20 50 20 S80 35 80 50 S65 80 50 80\' /><circle cx=\'50\' cy=\'50\' r=\'5\'/></svg></div></div><div class=\'dish-blob w-40 h-40 z-10 -top-4 -right-4\' style=\'background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, #eee, #ddd); border: 6px solid white;\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-30 text-xs italic\'>Ceviche Mar</div></div><div class=\'dish-blob w-32 h-32 z-30 bottom-12 -left-8\' style=\'background-image:linear-gradient(225deg, #f5f2ed, #eaddca); border: 4px solid white;\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-40 text-xs italic\'>Tartar Sol</div></div></section><section class=\'col-span-12 grid grid-cols-4 gap-6 mt-4\'><div class=\'bg-white p-6 card-shadow border border-gray-50 flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-terra font-serif text-2xl mb-2\'>01</span><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>Catering Privado</h3><p class=\'text-xs opacity-60\'>Eventos exclusivos dise\303\261ados a medida para su hogar o empresa.</p></div><div class=\'bg-white p-6 card-shadow border border-gray-50 flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-terra font-serif text-2xl mb-2\'>02</span><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>Chef en Casa</h3><p class=\'text-xs opacity-60\'>La excelencia de un restaurante Michelin en la intimidad de su mesa.</p></div><div class=\'bg-white p-6 card-shadow border border-gray-50 flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-terra font-serif text-2xl mb-2\'>03</span><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>Catas & Maridaje</h3><p class=\'text-xs opacity-60\'>Viajes sensoriales guiados por nuestros sumilleres expertos.</p></div><div class=\'bg-olive text-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center\'><h3 class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-2\'>\302\277Hablamos?</h3><p class=\'text-[10px] opacity-80 mb-4\'>Iniciemos la planeaci\303\263n de su pr\303\263ximo evento.</p><span class=\'border-b border-white border-opacity-40 text-[10px] pb-1 cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-tighter\'>Formulario de contacto</span></div></section></main><footer class=\'h-12 border-t border-black border-opacity-5 px-12 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] opacity-50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\'><div>Barcelona &bull; Madrid &bull; Marbella</div><div>&copy; 2024 Sabor Vivo - Alta Cocina</div></footer></body></html>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
