    thinking: "**Analyzing Brand Implementation**\n\nI\'m now methodically breaking down the \"Maceiras\" brand integration. I\'ve begun to tackle the implications for the tagline \342\200\223 considering both \"Catering & Chef Privado\" and \"Alta Gastronom\303\255a & Chef Privado\". My focus is on where the brand name must be reflected in the code: the `Navbar.tsx` and `HeroSection.tsx` files and their respective content, with attention to detail about the brand\'s feel.\n\n\n**Refining Brand Elements**\n\nI\'ve finalized the \"Maceiras\" brand elements, implementing the name consistently in `Footer.tsx` and `metadata.json`. I\'ve set up the phone number with working WhatsApp and phone links, ensuring the display is correct. Further, I have replaced the Michelin services and organic materials stats with the \"Atenci\303\263n Exclusiva,\" \"Ingredientes Frescos,\" and \"Llave en Mano\" for improved simplicity. Finally, I have pinpointed the content\'s Chilean context and incorporated locations relevant to this market, such as Santiago, Vi\303\261a del Mar, and Zapallar.\n\n\n**Updating Dish Information**\n\nI\'m now integrating the user\'s requested specialties: \"Filete Wellington con Risotto de Champi\303\261ones\" and \"Carpaccio de Res\" into the dishes. I\'ve accurately updated the `DISHES_DATA` with these main dishes and crafted detailed descriptions, considering the user\'s preference for personalized service. I have also added relevant tags for each dish, for easy searching and viewing.\n\n\n**Adding New Dishes**\n\nI\'ve just added three new dishes to the list. I have added \"Carpaccio de Res\" with a detailed description and relevant tags: \"Entrante de Autor\" and \"Fresco & Ligero\". I\'ve also incorporated the \"Cr\303\250me Br\303\273l\303\251e\" and its tags \"Postre Cl\303\241sico\" and \"Vainilla Natural\". Finally, I have updated the \"Lubina o Salm\303\263n a las Finas Hierbas con Vegetales Asados\" dish.\n\n\n"
