  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting Culinary Visuals**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing the `Hero3D.tsx` experience. The goal is to render mouthwatering, high-resolution 3D photography of Maceiras\' signature dishes: Filet Mignon, Cloche Seafood / Langostinos, and Cr\303\250me Br\303\273l\303\251e / Volc\303\241n de Cacao. The challenge now is to balance realism and artistic appeal to truly captivate the viewer.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Experience**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the design and technical implementation of the interactive 3D experience. I\'m focusing on incorporating a perspective depth effect with interactive card tilt using Three.js, complete with ambient particles and bokeh effects. I\'m implementing smooth parallax tilt on mouse move and aiming to add gold foil frame accents and interactive dish selection buttons for a premium feel.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 14
      nanos: 617810670
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
